  "solution": "BODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/c0j5U9v2oJWEzSTKvdDLWZ5Zik3PBUXk-C9w3Ma990WH63rpQUfA7g-3wh_uT7CgFvFJ4jPGEeOw509FxSgfh78_HR9tDNZ9KitXdEveKsLaLMgPQf6YSDt1b775728JMVp9FIQs=s0] \n\nThe given equation is:\n\n56 ÷ 8 × 6 − 10 + 14 = 38\n\n**1) Swap ÷ and ×**\n\nNew Equation: 56 × 8 ÷ 6 − 10 + 14 = ?\n\n⇒ 56 × (__**8 ÷ 6**__) − 10 + 14 \n\n⇒ (__**56 × 1.33**__) − 10 + 14 \n\n⇒ __**74.66. − 10**__ + 14 \n\n⇒ 64.66. + 14\n\n= 78.66... ≠ 38 (Incorrect)\n\n**2) Swap × and −**\n\nNew Equation: 56 ÷ 8 − 6 × 10 + 14 = ?\n\n⇒ (__**56 ÷ 8**__) − 6 × 10 + 14 \n\n⇒ 7 − (__**6 × 10**__) + 14 \n\n⇒ __**7 + 14**__ − 60 \n\n⇒ 21 − 60\n\n= −39 ≠ 38 (Incorrect)\n\n**3) Swap ÷ and +**\n\nNew Equation: 56 + 8 × 6 − 10 ÷ 14 = ?\n\n⇒ 56 + 8 × 6 − (__**10 ÷ 14**__) \n\n⇒ 56 + (__**8 × 6**__) − 0.71\n\n⇒ __**56 + 48**__ − 0.71\n\n⇒ 104 − 0.71\n\n= 103.28 ≠ 38 \n\n4) Swap + and −\n\nNew Equation: 56 ÷ 8 × 6 + 10 − 14 = ?\n\n⇒ **(56 ÷ 8)** × 6 + 10 − 14 \n\n⇒ (7 × 6) + 10 − 14 \n\n⇒ 42 + 10 − 14 \n\n⇒ 52 − 14 \n\n⇒ 38\n\n38 = 38 (Correct)\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
